From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SnowBall Contributors <dev@snowballmc.org>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Optimize biome column sampling

Independent 26.3 implementation inspired by MoePus's BiomeSpy 26.1
(LGPL-3.0-or-later), MoePus/BiomeSpy@77249eff02fb7cf9e971108309cfd2337753fe22.
Reuse only climate samples, not R-tree results. Defer column sampling
until a locate scan has passed its initial points. For multi-row Nether
preset structure columns, retain the compiler's volume evaluations but
avoid materializing rows already broadcast by a compiled Y slice. Leave
storage checks alone.

